  "description": "The very elite of the FLC Carbon series was designed to put you off the front of the field, the Pro is available as a complete bike or a frameset. Built with Haro M2X MegaMax technology and T-700 carbon fiber, innovative geometry and advanced features like a BB92 bottom bracket, tapered steerer and top shelf components, the FLC 29 Pro will help get everyone from local pros to weekend warriors across the finish line first.\nRock Shox SID RL 29 Taper, 100mm w/ PushLoc\nShimano XT 38/24 crankset with Press Fit BB92\nShimano XT front and rear derailleurs\nRitchey WCS 20mm riser bar 31.8mm / Ritchey WCS stem\nPrologo Chameleon grips\nPrologo Kappa Evo saddle\nRitchey WCS 1-bolt 31.6mm seatpost\nShimano XT, 10 speed shifters\nShimano Deore XT hydraulic disc brakes\nShimano HG-81, 10 speed, 11-34 cassette",
